WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:03.936
Video eleven. Payment, receipt and contra.

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:07.153
Your money is in the cash and in a bank
account.

00:00:07.083 --> 00:00:11.434
A payment, F5, takes money out, for example
for the rent.

00:00:11.363 --> 00:00:15.315
A receipt, F6, brings money in from a
customer.

00:00:15.245 --> 00:00:19.528
A contra, F4, moves money between the cash and
the bank.

00:00:19.829 --> 00:00:23.445
V opens the vouchers. F5 is a payment.

00:00:24.144 --> 00:00:30.229
In Account, select the cash or a bank account:
the money goes out of it. Here, HDFC Bank.

00:00:30.259 --> 00:00:36.743
Under Particulars, select the ledger that you
pay: Rent. Then the amount: ₹25,000.

00:00:36.773 --> 00:00:41.791
Type the narration, and press Ctrl+A. Hisaab
asks for the bank details.

00:00:41.821 --> 00:00:46.772
The transaction type is Cheque. Type the
favouring name, and A/c Payee.

00:00:47.472 --> 00:00:50.689
Hisaab fills the next cheque number of your
cheque book.

00:00:51.072 --> 00:00:53.688
Press Ctrl+A to save the payment.

00:00:55.345 --> 00:01:03.631
F6 is a receipt: the money comes in. HDFC
Bank, the party Sharma Traders, and ₹54,560.

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:10.215
Sharma Traders has bill-wise details. Agst Ref
shows the open bills: invoice 1 of 2 April.

00:01:10.245 --> 00:01:13.995
Select invoice 1. This receipt settles it in
full.

00:01:14.695 --> 00:01:19.312
Type the narration, and Ctrl+A. The bank
details come next.

00:01:19.428 --> 00:01:24.446
Received From shows the party. Type the cheque number
of the customer, and the name of the bank.

00:01:25.147 --> 00:01:27.763
Press Ctrl+A to save the receipt.

00:01:29.428 --> 00:01:36.979
F4 is a contra: money moves between cash and the bank. In
Account, select the bank that gets the money: HDFC Bank.

00:01:37.009 --> 00:01:43.291
Under Particulars, select Cash: ₹20,000. Type
the narration, and Ctrl+A.

00:01:43.992 --> 00:01:48.075
Here the transaction type is Cash: type Cash
in the list.

00:01:48.105 --> 00:01:50.721
Press Ctrl+A to save the contra.

00:01:51.873 --> 00:01:57.089
Before the three vouchers, HDFC Bank had
₹5,94,000.

00:01:57.019 --> 00:02:04.104
The cheque went out, the receipt and the cash
came in. Now it shows ₹6,43,560.

00:02:04.303 --> 00:02:07.587
Next: journal, credit note and debit note.

